{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-01-06 17:36:00', 'title': 'CALIFORNIA HEALTH & WELLNESS ASSISTING MEMBERS ACROSS CALIFORNIA DURING STATE OF EMERGENCY', 'text': "SACRAMENTO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN RESPONSE TO GOV. GAVIN NEWSOM'S DECLARED STATE OF EMERGENCY IN AMADOR, CALAVERAS, EL DORADO, NEVADA, PLACER, SIERRA AND YUBA COUNTIES, CALIFORNIA HEALTH & WELLNESS (CHW) IS PROVIDING SPECIAL ASSISTANCE TO MEMBERS AFFECTED BY THE SERIES OF WINTER STORM SYSTEMS. THESE SYSTEMS HAVE PRODUCED RECORD-BREAKING SNOWFALL, DAMAGING WINDS AND FLOODING. CHW WANTS TO ENSURE ITS MEMBERS HAVE ACCESS TO ESSENTIAL PRESCRIPTION MEDICATIONS, CRITICAL COMPANY INFORMATION"}{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-01-06 16:54:00', 'title': 'HEALTH NET ASSISTING MEMBERS ACROSS CALIFORNIA DURING STATE OF EMERGENCY', 'text': "SACRAMENTO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN RESPONSE TO GOV. GAVIN NEWSOM'S DECLARED STATE OF EMERGENCY IN LOS ANGELES, SACRAMENTO AND SAN BERNARDINO COUNTIES, HEALTH NET IS PROVIDING SPECIAL ASSISTANCE TO ENSURE MEMBERS AFFECTED BY THE SERIES OF WINTER STORM SYSTEMS. THESE SYSTEMS HAVE PRODUCED RECORD-BREAKING SNOWFALL, DAMAGING WINDS AND FLOODING. HEALTH NET WANTS TO ENSURE ITS MEMBERS HAVE ACCESS TO ESSENTIAL PRESCRIPTION MEDICATIONS, CRITICAL HEALTH NET INFORMATION AND OTHER HEALTHCARE SERVICES"}{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-01-06 07:00:00', 'title': 'CENTENE APPOINTS JIM MURRAY AS CHIEF TRANSFORMATION OFFICER', 'text': "ST. LOUIS, JAN. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JIM MURRAY HAS BEEN APPOINTED AS CHIEF TRANSFORMATION OFFICER. MR. MURRAY WILL REPORT TO SARAH LONDON, VICE CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD FOR CENTENE, AND WILL LEAD CENTENE'S PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED VALUE CREATION OFFICE AND THE CENTENE ADVANCED BEHAVIORAL HEALTH DIVISION."}